 of Neuroimmunology。About APSNI The International Society of Neuroimmunology is proud to partner once again with the Chinese Society for Immunology and Fujian Medical University to co-host APSNI 2026, held from December 3-6, 2026 in Fuzhou, China. The theme of the conference is \"Basic Research and Clinical Applications of Neuroimmunology across neurological disorders\". Join our co-Chairs, Local Organizing Committee, and domestic and international renowned experts to discuss cutting-edge research achievements, advanced clinical diagnostic, and treatment technologies in the field of neuroimmunology. Attend and present your work in in selected talks and posters and contribute to the Young Scientist Forum, hosted by Dr. Rui Li of Fujian Medical University, to celebrate cutting edge scientific contributions of the next generation of leaders. We are looking forward to seeing in Fuzhou! Co-Chairs: Dr. Fu-Dong Shi, Capital Medical University and President of the Neuroimmunology Committee of the Chinese Society of Immunology Dr. Wanjin Chen, Vice-President, Fujian Medical University Dr. Bo Huang, President, Chinese Society of Immunology Pr Wee Yong, Co-director, Global Schools of Neuroimmunology for ISNI, University of Calgary, Canada Local Organizing Committee: Dr. Jinzhou Feng, The First Affiliated Hospital of Chongqing Medical University Dr. Rui Li, Fujian Medical University, coordinator of the Young Scientist Forum Dr. Yujing Li, Tianjin Medical University General Hospital, conference secretariat Dr. Yi Lin, Fujian Medical University Dr. Honghao Wang, Guangzhou First People’s Hospital Ms. Na Xia, Fujian Medical University Dr. Chunsheng Yang, Tianjin Medical University General Hospital, conference secretariat Dr. Jian Chen, conference secretariat In partnership with Chinese Society for Immunology\n\n**URL:** https://www.isniweb.org/apsni\n\n---\n\n## 5. [第五届亚太神经免疫学校(APSNI2026) 会议通知](https://mm.sciconf.cn/cn/web/jump/35252?mid=3088891)\n\n第五届亚太神经免疫学校(APSNI2026) 会议通知。# 第五届亚太神经免疫学校(APSNI2026) 会议通知尊敬的各位专家、同仁:近年来,神经免疫学的基础与临床研究蓬勃发展,正深刻改变着我们对多发性硬化症、视神经脊髓炎谱系疾病等中枢神经系统疾病,吉兰-巴雷综合症/慢性炎性脱髓鞘多发性神经病等周围神经系统疾病,以及重症肌无力等神经肌肉接头疾病的认识和治疗策略。这一趋势在中国尤为显著。随着补体抑制剂、Fc受体拮抗剂以及多种单克隆抗体等疾病修正治疗药物的广泛应用,中国神经科医生和患者已拥有了前所未有的丰富治疗选择,患者预后前景也愈加乐观。中国神经免疫学界正与国际同行紧密合作,携手开展多项跨国临床试验,验证新型诊断检测方法,并推动患者人口统计学等数据汇入国际数据库。尤为值得关注的是,中国学者在部分新兴治疗探索领域已发挥引领作用,如开展针对进展型多发性硬化症的CAR-T治疗研究,并在该领域的基础科学方面做出了独特贡献。为推动我国神经免疫领域科技人员的交流与合作、充分整合临床资源,对接国际前沿动态,由国际神经免疫学会和中国免疫学会主办,福建医科大学协办的“第五届亚太神经免疫学校(APSNI 2026)”定于2026年12月3-6日,在中国福州举行。本次大会以“跨越神经系统疾病:神经免疫学从基础研究与临床应用”为主题。会议将邀请国内外知名专家学者、临床专家,分享神经免疫学领域的前沿研究成果及先进诊疗技术。会议首日将设立“青年学者论坛”,聚焦新生代青年学者的前沿科研成果。我们诚邀全球,特别是亚太地区的同行踊跃参会,通过专题报告或海报展示等形式交流最新科研进展。我们诚邀各位同仁莅临此次学术盛会!![](images/94641d27e4f9d95f8dfd4c5ab55415ad122f5d722fe178387c92dae50a233b26.jpg)text_image中国党中# 会议基本信息报到时间:2026年12月3日会议时间:2026年12月3-6日会议地点:泰禾凯宾斯基酒店,晋安区东二环横屿路1号,中国-福建-福州# 会议网站https://apsni2026.sciconf.cn# 组织机构主办单位:国际神经免疫学会(ISNI)中国免疫学会 (CSI)协办单位:中国免疫学会神经免疫分会(CSI-NI)福建医科大学 (FMU)# 大会主席Wee Yong 加拿大卡尔加里大学黄波 中国医学科学院北京协和医学院施福东 天津医科大学总医院/首都医科大学附属北京天坛医院\n\n**URL:** https://mm.sciconf.cn/cn/web/jump/35252?mid=3088891\n\n---\n\n## 6. [【福建·福州 2026年12月3-6日】第五届亚太神经免疫学校(APSNI2026)](http://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzU3MTY3MzAyMw==&mid=2247492173&idx=2&sn=c137226b4629b8f95804b993db30d679&chksm=fde7982847490e4fa071fa95b578dc3c48c1f5d180922d393e776323e8d61cc1235a294bbf0a#rd)\n\n关注后回复亚太神经免疫学报名及详情报到时间:2026年12月3日会议时间:2026年12月3-6日会议地点:泰禾凯宾斯基酒店,晋安区东二环横屿路1号,中国-福建-福州\nInternational Societ\nISNI\nof Neuroimmunolog\n5th Asia-Pacific School of\nNeuroimmunology\n(APSNI2026\nFuzhou December 3-6, 2026\nORGANIZER\nInternational Society of Neuroimmunology (ISNI)\nChinese Society for Immunology (CSI)\nHOSTED BY\nNeuro-immunology Committee of CSI\nFujian Medical University\nThe 5th Asia-Pacific School of Neuroimmunology\nAgenda\nKempinski Hotel, Fuzhou, China\nThursday, December 3rd, 2026\n09:00-20:00\nRegistration and Check-in\nYoung Investigator Forum (Yi Jin Hall- Level 3)\nSession 1: Chair: Rui Li (China)\nMichael Wheeler\n13:30-13:55\nNeur