              "snippet": "Schools International Society of Neuroimmunology。About APSNI The International Society of Neuroimmunology is proud to partner once again with the Chinese Society for Immunology and Fujian Medical University to co-host APSNI 2026, held from December 3-6, 2026 in Fuzhou, China. The theme of the conference is \"Basic Research and Clinical Applications of Neuroimmunology across neurological disorders\". Join our co-Chairs, Local Organizing Committee, and domestic and international renowned experts to discuss cutting-edge research achievements, advanced clinical diagnostic, and treatment technologies in the field of neuroimmunology. Attend and present your work in in selected talks and posters and contribute to the Young Scientist Forum, hosted by Dr. Rui Li of Fujian Medical University, to celebrate cutting edge scientific contributions of the next generation of leaders. We are looking forward to seeing in Fuzhou! Co-Chairs: Dr. Fu-Dong Shi, Capital Medical University and President of the Neuroimmunology Committee of the Chinese Society of Immunology Dr. Wanjin Chen, Vice-President, Fujian Medical University Dr. Bo Huang, President, Chinese Society of Immunology Pr Wee Yong, Co-director, Global Schools of Neuroimmunology for ISNI, University of Calgary, Canada Local Organizing Committee: Dr. Jinzhou Feng, The First Affiliated Hospital of Chongqing Medical University Dr. Rui Li, Fujian Medical University, coordinator of the Young Scientist Forum Dr. Yujing Li, Tianjin Medical University General Hospital, conference secretariat Dr. Yi Lin, Fujian Medical University Dr. Honghao Wang, Guangzhou First People’s Hospital Ms. Na Xia, Fujian Medical University Dr. Chunsheng Yang, Tianjin Medical University General Hospital, conference secretariat Dr. Jian Chen, conference secretariat In partnership with Chinese Society for Immunology",
              "site": "International Society of Neuroimmunology",
